<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">庄豆豆正在取图纸…</view><block wx:elif="{{pattern}}"><view class="hero"><view><text class="eyebrow">{{statusMap[pattern.status].label}}</text><text class="title">{{pattern.name}}</text><text class="meta">{{pattern.width||pattern.gridSize}} × {{pattern.height||pattern.gridSize}} 格 · {{pattern.colorCount}} 色 · {{pattern.totalBeads}} 颗</text></view><button class="rename" bindtap="rename">重命名</button></view><view class="sheet-card"><view class="tabs"><view class="tab {{tab==='preview'?'active':''}}" data-value="preview" bindtap="setTab">成品预览</view><view class="tab {{tab==='construction'?'active':''}}" data-value="construction" bindtap="setTab">色号施工图</view></view><image class="sheet" src="{{tab==='preview'?previewPath:constructionPath}}" mode="widthFix" bindtap="previewImage"/><text class="zoom">点击图片可放大查看</text></view><view class="status-card"><text class="section-title">这张图纸拼到哪了？</text><text class="section-note">{{statusMap[pattern.status].note}}</text><view class="status-actions"><button class="status-button {{pattern.status==='UNSTARTED'?'selected':''}}" data-value="UNSTARTED" bindtap="setStatus">以后拼</button><button class="status-button {{pattern.status==='IN_PROGRESS'?'selected':''}}" data-value="IN_PROGRESS" bindtap="setStatus">开始拼</button><button class="status-button completed {{pattern.status==='COMPLETED'?'selected':''}}" data-value="COMPLETED" bindtap="setStatus" disabled="{{pattern.status==='COMPLETED'}}">{{pattern.status==='COMPLETED'?'已拼完':'拼完了'}}</button></view></view><view class="usage-card"><text class="section-title">MARD 用量</text><view wx:for="{{pattern.usages}}" wx:key="code" class="usage-row"><text class="code">{{item.code}}</text><view class="usage-line"></view><text>{{item.quantity}} 颗</text></view></view></block></view><view wx:if="{{showCompleteDialog}}" class="dialog-mask" bindtap="closeCompleteDialog"><view class="complete-dialog" catchtap="stopPropagation"><view class="dialog-beads"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></view><text class="dialog-kicker">作品入册前的最后一步</text><text class="dialog-title">确认拼完了？</text><text class="dialog-copy">选择实际使用豆子的豆仓。确认后将按图纸色号扣除 <b>{{pattern.totalBeads}}</b> 颗豆子，库存不足时不会扣除。</text><scroll-view class="vault-list" scroll-y="true"><view wx:for="{{vaults}}" wx:key="id" class="vault-option {{selectedVaultId===item.id?'selected':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectCompleteVault"><view class="radio"><view class="radio-dot"></view></view><view class="vault-copy"><text class="vault-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="vault-note">从这个豆仓扣除 MARD 豆子</text></view><text wx:if="{{selectedVaultId===item.id}}" class="vault-selected">已选择</text></view></scroll-view><view wx:if="{{completeError}}" class="complete-error"><text>{{completeError}}</text></view><view class="dialog-actions"><button class="dialog-cancel" bindtap="closeCompleteDialog" disabled="{{completing}}">再等等</button><button class="dialog-confirm" bindtap="confirmComplete" loading="{{completing}}" disabled="{{completing||!selectedVaultId}}">{{completing?'正在扣除':'确认扣除并完成'}}</button></view></view></view>
